hadiths[6]{hadithnumber,text}:
"17684","Yunus ibn Muhammad narrated to us: Aban, meaning Ibn Yazid al-'Attar, narrated to us, from Yahya ibn Abi Kathir, from Abu Ibrahim, a shaykh from the Ansar, from his father, that the Prophet of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him), when he prayed over a funeral, would say: O Allah, forgive our living and our dead, our old and our young, our male and our female, our present and our absent."
"17685","'Abd al-Samad narrated to us, from Hisham, from Yahya ibn Abi Kathir, from Abu Ibrahim, from his father, that he narrated to him that he heard the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) say in prayer over the dead: O Allah, forgive our living and our dead, our present and our absent, our male and our female, our young and our old."
"17686","'Affan narrated to us: Aban narrated to us: Yahya ibn Abi Kathir narrated to us: A shaykh from the Ansar called Abu Ibrahim narrated to us, from his father, that the Prophet of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him), when he prayed over the dead, would say: O Allah, forgive our living and our dead, our present and our absent, our male and our female, our young and our old."
"17687","Yahya said: And Abu Salamah ibn 'Abd al-Rahman narrated to me this hadith from the Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him), and added in it: O Allah, whom You keep alive among us, keep him alive upon Islam, and whom You take among us, take him upon faith."
"17688","'Affan narrated to us: Hammam narrated to us: Yahya ibn Abi Kathir informed us: 'Abd Allah ibn Abi Qatadah narrated to us, from his father, that he witnessed the Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) pray over a dead person and heard him say: O Allah, forgive our living and our dead, our present and our absent, our young and our old, our male and our female. He said: And Abu Salamah narrated to me these eight words and added two words: Whom You keep alive among us, keep him alive upon Islam, and whom You take among us, take him upon faith."
"17689","'Affan narrated to us: Aban narrated to us: Yahya ibn Abi Kathir narrated to us, from Ibrahim, from the Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) the like of it."
